Where RivetIT comes from
------------------------

RivetIT is based on ITFlow, and all original credit for the code it
started from goes to the ITFlow project and its contributors:

  ITFlow
  https://github.com/itflow-org/itflow
  Copyright (C) the ITFlow contributors (itflow-org).
  Licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0.

It was developed from an MSP-focused fork of ITFlow, whose MSP workflow
additions (ticket automation, cron manager, worksheets, calendar sync, SLA
tracking, REST API extensions and more) are credited to TractorHacker /
Foley IT:

  TheTractorHacker/itflow
  https://github.com/TheTractorHacker/itflow
  Licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0.

It was published as "ITFlow Internal IT" before it was renamed RivetIT in
2026:

  https://github.com/TheTractorHacker/ITFlow-Internal-IT

RivetIT is an independent project. It is not the ITFlow project and is
not maintained or endorsed by the ITFlow maintainers; "ITFlow" is the
name of that upstream project and is used here only to credit it. Source
files, identifiers (such as the ITFlow\ PHP namespace) and the change
history keep their ITFlow origins; see REBRANDING.md for the names that
were kept and why.


